  {
    "slug": "springtime-in-the-west",
    "title": "Springtime In The West",
    "published": "2023-03-01",
    "description": [
      "This project began with a journey to various old gold mining towns and ghost towns situated around Montana, where I collected images to create photogrammetry models. I used full models such as the wagon and buildings in the first cut, along with photogrammetry-converted tileable materials visible on the freight depot and the roofs of some structures. To gain more knowledge about the use of photogrammetry in games, I followed Vertex School's \"Advanced Environment Art Bootcamp,\" which provided an in-depth understanding of the technique. The tutorial by FastTrack Tutorials helped me create most of the town. I hope to continue expanding this environment by scanning Montana's scenic beauty once the snow melts and spring has finally come."
    ],
